between the kingdom's imperial army and its oppressed natives. There, he learns that he is a prophetic warrior known as a \"bearer of cores' light,\" chosen to save the land from its evil king. Accompanied by a young boy named Zungurii and the eccentric witch Magisa, Dan travels across Grand Rolo and encounters the other chosen warriors through card battles.\n\nWith the name of the Clash King gaining fame throughout Grand Rolo, secrets that lurk within the shadows of the kingdom's colonial past begin to surface. Only time will tell if Dan's campaign will affect the world on a scale much larger than he ever could have imagined.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Card Battle","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kids","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Butler","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Battle Spirits: Shounen Gekiha Dan","english":null,"native":"バトルスピリッツ 少年激覇ダン","romaji":"Battle Spirits: Shounen Gekiha Dan","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"战斗之魂 少年激霸弹"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Battle Spirits"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}